  "scope": "Kubernetes v1.36.1 native ValidatingAdmissionPolicy on updates to one synthetic ConfigMap release record. Two independently authenticated, short-lived ServiceAccount tokens represent the case developer and an approved reviewer. The policy binds the approver field to request.userInfo.username, preserves the original proposer and fixed release ID, denies developer self-approval, and permits the distinct reviewer to persist the same approval decision. This does not exercise a model registry, production promotion controller, human identity provider, quorum, cross-tenant workflow, artifact verification, or model execution.",
